      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 2,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "使出強大的招式就能獲勝……\n寶可夢對戰才沒有那麼簡單！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĺ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 176,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F7F51FA5F375927768462DB5F0F5C3180FD737252DD20262026000A5BF653EF59225C0D6230624D6C92670990A39EBC7C2155AEFF01001000020114013A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 32
    },
    {
      "displayText": "為了要教導大家這個道理，\n所以我持續不斷地在戰鬥。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĺ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 240,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "70BA4E86898165595C0E59275BB69019500B90537406FF0C000A62404EE5621163017E8C4E0D65B75730572862309B253002001000020114013A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "如果<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳渴望變強，\n就讓我來教教<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳能削減所受傷害的招式……<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n也就是「牆壁」的重要性吧。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĺ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 8,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 300,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5982679C00100003110000FF01014F6059B36E34671B8B8A5F37FF0C000A5C318B9362114F866559655900100003110000FF01014F6059B380FD524A6E1B624053D750B75BB3768462DB5F0F2026202600100001BE00000A4E5F5C31662F300C724658C1300D768491CD8981602754273002001000020114013A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 62
    },
    {
      "displayText": "想對戰的話，就來跟我搭話吧。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĺ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 424,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "60F35C0D623076848A71FF0C5C314F868DDF6211642D8A7154273002001000020114013A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 19
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0005>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 464,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00050000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我可以教教<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳牆壁的厲害，\n但<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳準備好了嗎？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĺ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 476,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "621153EF4EE56559655900100003110000FF01014F6059B3724658C1768453B25BB3FF0C000A4F4600100003110000FF01014F6059B36E965099597D4E8655CEFF1F001000020114013A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 38
    },
    {
      "displayText": "準備好囉！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 552,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6E965099597D56C9FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "還沒",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 564,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "90846C920000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 3
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我也能理解<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳那份不想準備的心情。\n畢竟任誰都不想上場後被打敗嘛。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĺ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 572,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62114E5F80FD740689E300100003110000FF01014F6059B390A34EFD4E0D60F36E96509976845FC360C53002000A75627ADF4EFB8AB090FD4E0D60F34E0A58345F8C88AB62536557561B3002001000020114013A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 43
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我的寶可夢使用的招式\n會讓對手攻擊的傷害減少！<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n有些人會稱之為築牆！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĺ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 660,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "621176845BF653EF59224F7F7528768462DB5F0F000A67038B935C0D624B653B64CA768450B75BB36E1B5C11FF0100100001BE00000A67094E9B4EBA67037A314E4B70BA7BC97246FF01001000020114013A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 42
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+000B>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 744,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳未免也太強了！\n根本沒必要教<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳什麼是牆啊。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĺ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 756,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100003110000FF01014F6059B3672A514D4E5F592A5F374E86FF01000A6839672C6C925FC58981655900100003110000FF01014F6059B34EC09EBC662F7246554A3002001000020114013A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 39
    },
    {
      "displayText": "但這是約定，所以我還是教<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳\n我的寶可夢用了什麼招式吧……<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĺ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 836,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F469019662F7D045B9AFF0C62404EE562119084662F655900100003110000FF01014F6059B3000A621176845BF653EF592275284E864EC09EBC62DB5F0F542720262026001000020114013A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 39
    },
    {
      "displayText": "反射壁會在一段時間內\n減輕來自對手的物理攻擊的傷害。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĺ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 916,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "53CD5C0458C1670357284E006BB5664295935167000A6E1B8F154F8681EA5C0D624B768472697406653B64CA768450B75BB33002001000020114013A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "光牆會在一段時間內\n減輕來自對手的特殊攻擊的傷害。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĺ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 980,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "51497246670357284E006BB5664295935167000A6E1B8F154F8681EA5C0D624B768472796B8A653B64CA768450B75BB33002001000020114013A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "要是能削減對手招式的傷害，\n也就能增加我方行動時的選項。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĺ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 1040,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8981662F80FD524A6E1B5C0D624B62DB5F0F768450B75BB3FF0C000A4E5F5C3180FD589E52A0621165B9884C52D566427684907898053002001000020114013A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "呃，這樣對打贏自己的對手\n東說西說地說明還真是難為情。<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n而且<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳應該會把各式各樣的招式\n有效地組合使用才是。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĺ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 1108,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5443FF0C90196A235C0D62538D0F81EA5DF176845C0D624B000A67718AAA897F8AAA57308AAA660E9084771F662F96E370BA60C5300200100001BE01000A800C4E1400100003110000FF01014F6059B361C98A726703628A54045F0F54046A23768462DB5F0F000A6709654857307D4454084F7F7528624D662F3002001000020114013A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 67
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0012>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 1244,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00120000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "把各式各樣的招式有效地組合使用，\n就能將勝利收進自己的手中呢。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĺ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
